# Between Us — project intelligence

## Repository split (never mix)
- Website (`betweenus_landing`): betweenus.fun — discovery, SEO, Journal, acquisition
- App (this repo): com.betweenus.app — community, Spill, reactions, retention
- Supabase: one auth + one content system for all platforms

## Security
- Baseline: SECURITY_AUDIT_REPORT.md (2026-08-24)
- Never trust client userId/ownerId/role/premium/moderation/ads
- After backend changes: `npm run test:security` must stay 16/16+

## Naming
- Personal check-in journal ≠ editorial Between Us Journal
- Spill = post create; Me Too = signature reaction (not yet built)

## Domain
- Do not add CNAME for betweenus.fun in the app repo
- Do not redirect root website to the app shell
